sed to differ.","j":14,"h":28,"s":16,"a":124,"sd":null},{"k":"16:125","t":"Invite to the way of your Lord with wisdom and good instruction, and argue with them in a way that is best. Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who has strayed from His way, and He is most knowing of who is [rightly] guided.","j":14,"h":28,"s":16,"a":125,"sd":null},{"k":"16:126","t":"And if you punish [an enemy, O believers], punish with an equivalent of that with which you were harmed. But if you are patient - it is better for those who are patient.","j":14,"h":28,"s":16,"a":126,"sd":null},{"k":"16:127","t":"And be patient, [O Muḥammad], and your patience is not but through Allāh. And do not grieve over them and do not be in distress over what they conspire.","j":14,"h":28,"s":16,"a":127,"sd":null},{"k":"16:128","t":"Indeed, Allāh is with those who fear Him and those who are doers of good.","j":14,"h":28,"s":16,"a":128,"sd":null}],"juz":14,"hizb":28,"surahs":[16],"sajdah":false}